Package: hd-cups
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: cups
Conflicts: avahi-daemon, sane-utils
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian printing support
 Installs CUPS, the print server, which is set up through its web interface
 on http://localhost:631.
 .
 It keeps avahi-daemon, which cups recommends, and sane-utils, the scanner
 tools, from being installed. Adding users to the group lpadmin, which may
 manage the printers, is left to the administrator.
